  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e76c92731d0785f4",
      "translationZh": "本文档汇集了 Shreya 和我在向 5,000+ 名工程师和产品经理教授 AI 评估时收到的最常见问题。提醒：这些是关于在大多数情况下什么方法有效的鲜明观点，并非普遍真理。请自行判断。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5aeb01155523c3d",
      "translationZh": "浏览你感兴趣的问题，或选择下方的一份指南，沿着精心编排的阅读路线阅读常见问题及相关文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d903f2a079c1e20d",
      "translationZh": "你处于哪个阶段？这听起来像我",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07d621844da3a037",
      "translationZh": "我听说过这个术语，但不确定评估涉及哪些内容，也不知道自己是否需要它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67915f4587cd0729",
      "translationZh": "我不知道该测试什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3feb4fbc89da5af",
      "translationZh": "我正在开发一款 AI 产品，但还没弄清楚该衡量哪些失败情况，或怎样的表现才算好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6ca6ee5123cb59f",
      "translationZh": "我不信任自己的评估分数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e96dd68cd3f32214",
      "translationZh": "我们有评估，但分数与我们对输出的判断不一致，或者测试虽然通过了，用户却仍然遇到问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7de4220bebd81412",
      "translationZh": "我觉得自己的产品太难评估了",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95aa3f0ed9a11efb",
      "translationZh": "我们的输出具有主观性、篇幅很长，或者涉及许多步骤。即使是知识丰富的人，也很难判断这些输出是否正确。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "236df8b8e4b5e8f2",
      "translationZh": "评估太耗时间或金钱",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7aa6d47787e4b876",
      "translationZh": "我们在审查输出、维护测试或运行评估器上投入了太多精力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f6092ed83d4320d",
      "translationZh": "按章节浏览所有问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ebdfd34d3e0b2858",
      "translationZh": "入门与基础",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2404e06ee2e086fd",
      "translationZh": "问：最小可行的评估方案是什么样的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2cc167d263012100",
      "translationZh": "问：我应该将开发预算中的多大比例分配给评估？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6525113d45ea908",
      "translationZh": "问：鉴于 AI 变化如此之快，今天的评估方法在 5-10 年后还适用吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ecc9a5e94270e9dd",
      "translationZh": "问：我该如何向团队说明投入资源进行评估的必要性？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d094a317067e19a",
      "translationZh": "错误分析与数据收集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "967ffffae4cb0cd7",
      "translationZh": "问：为什么“错误分析”在 AI 评估中如此重要，又该如何进行？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fe601d3e75e7692",
      "translationZh": "问：在标注数据之前，我需要先有参考答案或评分标准吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a378cc254fbd5a95",
      "translationZh": "问：我是否应该记录那些并非模型过错所导致的问题？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3dd1fa37513c8abb",
      "translationZh": "问：进行一次评估需要多少个样例？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dbe01e9761383809",
      "translationZh": "问：除了用户反馈之外，我该如何找出有问题的执行轨迹以供审查？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb3be8a0c407d8c6",
      "translationZh": "问：我应该多久对生产系统重新进行一次错误分析？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef61d3c9316d5fd2",
      "translationZh": "问：当我的“金标准”评估数据集过时时，我应该怎么做？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42aeb6931ae725a8",
      "translationZh": "问：生成合成数据的最佳方法是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91d3682723a5b918",
      "translationZh": "问：是否存在合成数据可能不可靠的场景？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d97b263572dc2352",
      "translationZh": "问：当追踪记录包含敏感数据时，我该如何进行评估？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56c177dcffe735e0",
      "translationZh": "问：当我的系统处理多种多样的用户查询时，我该如何开展评估？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "122d523ea5b8ed48",
      "translationZh": "问：我该如何高效地对生产环境中的追踪记录进行抽样审查？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3efc1834383de191",
      "translationZh": "评估设计与方法论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d39f30300854c5ca",
      "translationZh": "问：为什么你推荐二元（通过/不通过）评估，而不是 1-5 分评分（李克特量表）？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03d77d85fe381f4b",
      "translationZh": "问：如何将我的各项评估合并成一个指标？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1afd5704d7ec441c",
      "translationZh": "问：我应该采用评估驱动开发吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59b7c46c2270522b",
      "translationZh": "问：我应该为发现的每一种失效模式都构建自动评估器吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a748bfd430363149",
      "translationZh": "问：我应该使用什么模型或 LLM 来构建自动化评估？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df3378ef309dc48e",
      "translationZh": "问：我可以使用 Jev 进行评估吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "171ff343f7cc670f",
      "translationZh": "问：如何判断我的自动化评估是否可信？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd0b9de1656e0a55",
      "translationZh": "问：当我的 LLM 评判器无法与人工审核者达成一致时，我该怎么办？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "add8bd2b974bd564",
      "translationZh": "问：我应该使用“现成可用”的评估指标吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fa415bd75a463ee",
      "translationZh": "问：相似度指标（BERTScore、ROUGE 等）对于评估 LLM 输出有用吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5047fd888fec3bd2",
      "translationZh": "问：我可以用同一个模型同时完成主要任务和评估吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "273fc6341162fc94",
      "translationZh": "问：我应该给 LLM 评判者提供多少上下文？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a161d59587bbe920",
      "translationZh": "问：我们如何评估模型表达不确定性或“知道自己不知道什么”的能力？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38c16d15c8597b9d",
      "translationZh": "人工标注与流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc84f2cab8484c70",
      "translationZh": "问：应该由多少人来标注我的 LLM 输出？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e2a65a79f6af3968",
      "translationZh": "问：我如何让 AI 输出更容易供人评估？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
